## Warranty Disclaimer

This software is provided AS-IS. ALB_C512 is an **experimental algorithm** and has
not undergone formal independent security audit. It should not be used for
production security applications without:

1. External cryptographic review from security experts
2. Formal security analysis and proofs
3. Implementation audit and hardening for your specific use case
4. Regulatory approval (if applicable to your jurisdiction/industry)

Users assume full responsibility for assessing whether ALB_C512 meets their
security requirements and threat model.

